#!/usr/bin/env python3
# AnimeStage – control program for the anime KDE theme.
#
# One central config (~/.config/animestage/config.json) describes character,
# colors, style and images. All widgets read it live; this program
# generates the color scheme, Plasma style, window decoration, Konsole colors,
# splash and lock screen from it and downloads the images.

